  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FCI Konferens</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCI Women deliver - FCI Jubileums konf</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats syftar till att delfinansiera Women Deliver en konferens som samlar ledande experter p&#xe5; SRHR och m&#xf6;drah&#xe4;lsa till att p&#xe5; detta s&#xe4;tt h&#xf6;gtidligh&#xe5;lla 20-&#xe5;rs jubileet av Safe motherhood Initiative och samlas runt kunskapsutveckling och p&#xe5;verkansarbete f&#xf6;r att visa hur j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet, kvinnors h&#xe4;lsa, tilv&#xe4;xt och h&#xe5;llbar utveckling &#xe4;r beroende av varandra.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution aims to co-finance the Woman Deliver Conference that aims to focus the 20th anniversary of the Safe Motherhood Initiative and to gather the leading experts as well as political leadership around knowledge development and advocacy to show how gender equality, women&apos;s health, economic growth and sustainable development are intrinsicly dependant on one another.</narrative>
  </description>
